          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nono Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, aandalasia endakaano niyo wakholela ese ne lisaaye liase. Khola niko waloma oli okhakhole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efuma yowo echa khubao buli lwosi. Ne babaandu bakhalome bali, ‘Omwami Owe Banamae niye Wele owa Isiraeli.’ Okhaliinde lisaaye liase buli lwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila ewe Omwami Owe Banamae, Wele owa Isiraeli, wamboolela ese oli ‘Nja khukhwombakhila enju. Niko kakila ese omukholi wowo, ne khusaba ndio.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
